    "title": "Sources & further reading",
    "body": "<p>Entry rules and roaming: <a href='https://europa.eu/youreurope/citizens/travel/entry-exit/non-eu-nationals/index_en.htm' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>europa.eu/youreurope</a>. Emergency contacts and couvert law: <a href='https://www.gov.pt/guias/contactos-de-emergencia-em-portugal' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>gov.pt</a> and <a href='https://pgdlisboa.pt/leis/lei_mostra_articulado.php?nid=726&tabela=leis' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>pgdlisboa.pt</a>.</p><p>Lisbon sights: <a href='https://www.museusemonumentos.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>museusemonumentos.pt</a> (Belém Tower, Jerónimos), <a href='https://castelodesaojorge.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>castelodesaojorge.pt</a>, <a href='https://www.maat.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>maat.pt</a>, <a href='https://www.visitlisboa.com/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>visitlisboa.com</a>.</p><p>Sintra: <a href='https://www.parquesdesintra.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>parquesdesintra.pt</a> (Pena Palace, Moorish Castle, Monserrate, National Palace) and <a href='https://www.regaleira.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>regaleira.pt</a>.</p><p>Porto: <a href='https://www.livrarialello.pt/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>livrarialello.pt</a>, <a href='https://www.torredosclerigos.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>torredosclerigos.pt</a>, <a href='https://visitporto.travel/en-GB' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>visitporto.travel</a> (the official municipal tourism site — not the similarly-named porto.travel, a private lookalike), <a href='https://www.sandeman.com/port-wine/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>sandeman.com</a>, <a href='https://www.taylor.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>taylor.pt</a>.</p><p>Transit: <a href='https://www.metrolisboa.pt/en/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>metrolisboa.pt</a>, <a href='https://www.carris.pt/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>carris.pt</a>, <a href='https://www.cp.pt/' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>cp.pt</a> (fares not independently confirmable against a live fetch — its ticketing site is JS-rendered).</p>"
